hishek S", "text": "This is a terrible tune. The ghazal is fantastic. I sing it to myself many a time, but in a tune of my own like all things 🤣", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T13:08:38Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "हो गई है पीर पर्वत-सी पिघलनी चाहिए,\nइस हिमालय से कोई गंगा निकलनी चाहिए।\nआज यह दीवार, परदों की तरह हिलने लगी,\nशर्त लेकिन थी कि ये बुनियाद हिलनी चाहिए।\nहर सड़क पर, हर गली में, हर नगर, हर गाँव में,\nहाथ लहराते हुए हर लाश चलनी चाहिए।\nसिर्फ हंगामा खड़ा करना मेरा मकसद नहीं,\nसारी कोशिश है कि ये सूरत बदलनी चाहिए।\nमेरे सीने में नहीं तो तेरे सीने में सही,\nहो कहीं भी आग, लेकिन आग जलनी चाहिए।", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T13:11:41Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Awesome Q. Both Snowcrash and Stranger in a.. are novels i re read frequently. Also Stephenson’s ‘Diamond Age’ is a must read, predicted AI-based chatbots 25 y before chatgpt. His latest series ‘Polostan’ is also a riveting read", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T13:18:37Z", "username": "Shubhankar", "text": "@⁨Aditi Bapat⁩ ma’am I don’t think I’ll be able to make it in time for the quiz 🥲\nReally sorry for backing out at the last moment 🥹", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T13:20:54Z", "username": "Aditi Bapat", "text": "No worries Shubhankar! @⁨Kartikey Pradhan⁩ next tribute if he can still make it. Or anyone else who's on the zoom today 😊 ‎<This message was edited>", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T13:21:16Z", "username": "Aditi Bapat", "text": "And what's with everyone calling me ma'am? 😶", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-12T13:22:52Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Dang